{{Quote|And the sky seemed gigantic out here&mdash;it went on forever, above the ''Iridium Mountains'' capped with snow. White snow.|[[Tivoche Bilure]]|<ref name="Tales" />}}
The '''Iridium Mountains''' was a mountain range on the [[planet]] [[Vandor]]. [[Fort Ypso]] and the [[Crispin Imperial Depository]] were both located there.<ref name="Official Guide" />

